1. AI has gotten good enough to superforecast.
1. AI will or already has be capable of superpersuasion.
1. [Astroturfing](https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c4ng24pxkelo) is already rife on the internet. This will or already has been automated.
1. Garbage in Garbage Out
  - Protect your stimulus. You have a limited number of fucks. Choose wisely what you consume.
  - Outrage bait is an addiction, if you are addicted to it work on getting it taken away

## For top-down news

1. Reading from established publications (ideally paid) helps control some biases
